# Upload files (keep .gitkeep placeholders)
# Ignore everything saved directly at the uploads root (posts/business/jobs/
# events/standalone-upload endpoints save flat here), but re-include the
# named subdirectories themselves so the more specific rules below can still
# apply inside them (git won't descend into an ignored directory otherwise).
uploads/*
!uploads/profiles/
!uploads/resumes/
!uploads/certificates/
!uploads/videos/
!uploads/communities/
!uploads/posts/
!uploads/business/
!uploads/events/
!uploads/jobs/
uploads/profiles/*
uploads/resumes/*
uploads/certificates/*
uploads/videos/*
uploads/communities/*
uploads/posts/*
uploads/business/*
uploads/events/*
uploads/jobs/*
!uploads/profiles/.gitkeep
!uploads/resumes/.gitkeep
!uploads/certificates/.gitkeep
!uploads/videos/.gitkeep
!uploads/communities/.gitkeep
!uploads/posts/.gitkeep
!uploads/business/.gitkeep
!uploads/events/.gitkeep
!uploads/jobs/.gitkeep

